    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Morning, everyone! The weather's not bad at all today, wouldn't you say, Uncle Oliver?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, it's you. I was just asking, who else could it be knocking at the crack of dawn? But it's a gloomy day today no matter where you look. What's to appreciate?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Any time it's not raining is good weather. That's what you get in County Hillock. For that matter, how do you know the day's not going to turn clear skies?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine, you've got me there. Shredder, you stop dilly-dallying. We haven't got anyone dropping in, it's just Janie, daily ditcher.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're one to talk. Shredder, you come over here with us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I brought you a yuccoffee pie today, and some shortbread. Da sent me some tea last week, so I've brought that too. Uncle Oliver, is there any evaporated milk left?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leftovers started molding ages ago. That bloody man\u2014never remembers to go buy any.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Shredder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't it your turn on the shopping? Or am I hallucinating, somehow?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fred! Will! We need your thoughts too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, alright, it's not worth crying over this little spilled milk. Look, what's this? Fresh new evaporated, and some cheese too. Picked them up along the way from the morning market. Here, you can have them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hee-hee, I've wanted to try making milk tea for forever now. I think you'll like it at least, Uncle Oliver.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, still no one more considerate than you, Janie. Will, you'd better learn well. At least don't start acting like that man next to you with Shredder for a codename.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_090"
    },
    {
        "text": "This shortbread tastes delicious... ooh, right, Miss Willow, isn't your senior officer going to get on your case for running here every day to bring us breakfast?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Will"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Victorian Army's rules are a fair deal strict, if I recall.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Shredder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah... you don't need to worry about that. I'm a guard of honor, I'm only good for big events or recruitment drives. They don't have much use to put me to\u2014the Sergeant Major wouldn't even think about me most of the time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, it's not like I don't do anything proper.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Every morning when I get up, the first thing I do is pull this banner off its support.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "While I wait for the flour to ferment and the coffee to brew, I'll straighten out the creases bit by bit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once the shortbread's done, that means I have to wash the flour off me. It takes time for my hair to dry naturally, and that's the perfect time to care for the flagpole, and let it shine like brand new.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uncle Oliver, don't rush to pick up your tea yet\u2014it's still too hot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "For a complete morning, everything needs to glow gorgeous, no exceptions. Only then can I bring joy to you all\u2014that's my life's creed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the pie like today, Shredder? Want any more?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perfect... Just like every day before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Shredder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Really? Let me try some too... seems I put a little too much sugar in. I'll make sure to watch out for that tomorrow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_090"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I'm not going to tell you off for being lazy like they do now, Miss Willow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Will"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Janie. That's what everyone calls me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_090"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, er... Miss Jane. My honest fear's that they'll want me spending every morning as amply as you do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Will"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No need for that. I'm not like any of you, there's only so much I can do for the people here. Hm... I think the tea's about the right temperature now. Just make sure to stir it a little before you drink\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
