    {
        "text": "You sent the ball flyin' again, Craig!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Child A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_240"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Craig"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_240"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll go get it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Craig"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, poo... it went in the building.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Child A"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you actually hit any of the grown-ups, then, then you're in for it! Last time, didn't Carol get...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Child A"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Huff*, *huff*... Someone's come out, let's run!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Child A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_240"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh...",
        "tag": "name",
