    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_240",
        "name2": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're too shy about it, I won't hand it back. Come on, hold your hand out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_240",
        "name2": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Craig"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are... Are you gonna beat me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Craig"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_240",
        "name2": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why would I beat you, now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_240",
        "name2": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Your clothes got dirty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Craig"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_240",
        "name2": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh, that's just me being careless. It's no matter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_240",
        "name2": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "All the other grown-ups like you, they don't care if it wasn't me who got them dirty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Craig"
    },
    {
        "text": "They always beat us. But not with their hands, they kick us instead. And they shout all loud, to scare us off.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Craig"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_240",
        "name2": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_240",
        "name2": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That means they're definitely not your friends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_240",
        "name2": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you live around here? I think I've spotted you before. Doesn't your ma sell apples at the crack of every dawn, down the alley in District Seventeen nearby?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_240",
        "name2": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Your family's apples are scrumptious. Not too crisp, but still very, very sweet. Perfect for making apple butter and spreading onto bread.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "text": "How about this? I'll put the ball on the windowsill here, and you come pick it up, okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
