        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "21_G9_rhodes_xqoffice",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "Got into a commotion outside?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Children playing ball.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those bunch of rotters, all higgledy-piggledly in the street first thing in the morning. I bet it was them who broke that last windowpane, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha... children, you know? I broke the man next door's flowerpots when I was young, and my da really gave me a talking-to for that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "You laid hands on that boy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Shredder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just now? Yeah, if I didn't wipe his hair clean, it'd be sticky all day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "His father passed away, half a year ago. Poor bloke, caught Oripathy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Shredder"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a lot\u2014'cause of that\u2014won't dare touch him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Shredder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "Workers, fairly strapped for cash. That Oriron byproduct processing plant has a partnership, with Aneca. But they don't give the full amount of prophylactics.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Shredder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's normal for you\u2014to hesitate. In their neighborhood, it's about one in five houses, turning out to have Oripathy patients.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Shredder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "They care for another, in a sense. If those soldiers weren't here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Shredder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shredder! You've lost track.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's alright... you're just stating the facts. I've heard how... my coworkers treat the Oripathy-sick... no, not just the sick, they've got the wrong idea about all of the residents.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I don't think the same way. We're all Victorians, aren't we? Their days might be hard on them, I\u2014I understand full well. But I hope for them to live a little happier too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you think... Should I have been even better to that child?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Don't force yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Shredder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_090"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the long faces for? I'll bring the playing cards out. Wasn't it you who suggested a spot of tea with cards, Miss Jane?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Will"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. Will's right, the sun's poking out for once in a while. Let's not waste the good weather.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take a seat, everyone. I'll pour you all some more tea; there's still plenty left in the pot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_090"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that me who's won again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Will"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's too early to be full of yourself. You're on shift tonight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_090"
    },
    {
        "text": "What? How's it me again?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Will"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not clicking? That was our stakes! Whoever won at cards is on broom duty, file sorting, buying us all afternoon tea...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_090"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can I get a redeal?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Will"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uncle Oliver, your jokes are putting Will in tears again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't that the fun of a game of cards? Ha-ha-ha-ha!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "One small tip\u2014next time you try second dealing, remember to watch behind you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "What\u2014?! Who's talking?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$marketplace_intro",
        "key": "$marketplace_loop",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "And on a side note, the tea's an excellent brew.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "H\u2014Hello! Who might you be?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(She came in suddenly, and none of us noticed her...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "They call me Outcast, my young Vouivran beauty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry I tasted your tea without asking. Seeing as I rushed all the way over here, I hope you won't mind too much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "F... Feel\u2014feel free. If you haven't eaten breakfast yet, would you like to try some pie I baked? It might be a little sweet...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd love to. Everybody who knows me knows I love sweets\u2014especially the Victorian kind. You got it baked like this to fancy, adorable perfection.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha... Thank you for the encouragement, Lady Outcast.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Outcast. Nobody calls me a Lady, really. I'm more of that 'Lass' type.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "I\u2014I know who you are! I remember now... Will! C-Clean the table up, quick\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_089"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought you'd be here two days later... Last message, you said you'd just passed the border.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Shredder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Couldn't help it, I haven't been to Victoria in a decade. Some parts are a bit more crowded, but just like me, the years are starting to show in a few places.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I hadn't hitched a ride the wrong way in County Peninsula, we would've met last night.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* Ahem, your understanding, please. County Hillock's not the biggest spot on the map, and we rarely get elite operators at our branch office here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "text": "Last time I was out near Minos on field work, I met Stormeye\u2014that was two years ago, already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Elite operator? Just the name sounds like a force to be reckoned with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Rhodes Island gives different work to different people, that's all. Besides, I'm pretty much just a civil servant now. I only came to County Hillock to fetch some data.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're too modest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "On the topic of data, did you want to see our finance forms first, or the ledger for our inventory in/out and stock this half... (Hints to Will)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold your beasties.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're not THAT pressed for time. No need to hurl a starving girl like me straight into work. It's only fair to let me steal a breather here and there, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha... I can sympathize greatly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hope I haven't disrupted your little R&R here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
